[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=CoolerControl
Comment=Launch the CoolerControl GUI at login. It starts minimized to the system tray if "Start in Tray" is enabled in the app's settings (a per-user preference). The coolercontrold daemon that actually drives the fans runs separately as a system service.
Exec=coolercontrol
Icon=org.coolercontrol.CoolerControl
Terminal=false
Categories=System;Settings;
X-GNOME-Autostart-enabled=true
